{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And he shall offer of the sacrifice of peace-offerings</b>, etc. It does not write washing the entrails and the shanks in peace-offerings, because the owners have a portion in them, and each person prepares his portion as he wishes." "<b>The fat.</b> An expression of good and praise, and so the Targum implies: תרבא — an expression of increase and greatness, that is, that by which the animal is praised."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:49.627678584Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}